  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium-high heat",
    "add the chopped onion and sauté for 5 minutes",
    "add the minced garlic and sauté for 1 minute",
    "add the sliced forced-rhubarb and sauté for 2 minutes",
    "add the chicken broth and bring to a boil",
    "add the rice and stir to coat with the broth",
